{
  "job_C16.1_20251003_115213": {
    "chunk_text": ", aliquam turbationem significat wilde deor yrnende gesih\u00f0 sume Balneo se lauare, anxietatem significat on be\u00fee hine \u00fewean anxsumnesse getacna\u00fe. Barbatum se uiderit, ornamentum significat gebyrdne hine gesih\u00f0 gl\u00e6ncge getacna\u00f0. Byrrum album habere, letitiam significat oferslop hwit haban blisse getacna\u00fe. Byrrum coloreum habere, nuntium fedum significat oferslop bleofah habban \u00e6rende fullic getacna\u00fe. Bella uel barbaros uiderit, letitiam in publico patet gefeohtu o\u00f0\u00f0e he\u00feene gesih\u00f0 blisse on openum hit Butirum edere, nuntium bonum significat buteran etan h\u00e6rende god getacna\u00fe. Boues pascentes uiderit agoniam negotii significat oxan grasiende gesih\u00f0 sige ceapas getacna\u00fe. Boues dormientes uiderit, malitiam negotii significat oxan slapende gesih\u00f0 yfelnysse ceapes getacna\u00fe. Bestias loquentes uiderit, molestias graues significat wilde deor sprecende gesih\u00f0 teonan hefige Clamide uestiri securitatem significat mid rocce beon gescrid orsorhnysse getacna\u00fe. Coronam cuiusque rei accipere letitiam significat cynehelm gewilces \u00feinges onfon blisse hit getacna\u00f0. Cecum qui se uiderit, inpeditionem significat blindne se\u00fee hine gesih\u00f0 lettincge getacna\u00fe. C\u00eblum flamineum uiderit, aliquas iniquitates in toto orbe obueniunt heofen ligenne gesih\u00f0 sume Cucumeres aut cucurbitas uiderit in somnis, infirmitatem significat hwerhwettan o\u00f0\u00f0e cyrfet gesih\u00f0 on Ceram aridam",
